# GoreeVault review ownership
#
# GoreeVault is maintained by GoreeCloud. Upstream Vaultwarden maintainers are
# not automatically responsible for reviewing GoreeVault-specific changes.

# Repository automation, policy, release, and security workflows
/.github/** @GoreeCloud
/SECURITY.md @GoreeCloud
/CONTRIBUTING.md @GoreeCloud
/GOREVAULT.md @GoreeCloud
/.trivyignore.yaml @GoreeCloud
/docs/** @GoreeCloud

# Dependency and build inputs
/Cargo.toml @GoreeCloud
/Cargo.lock @GoreeCloud
/build.rs @GoreeCloud
/docker/** @GoreeCloud
/deploy/** @GoreeCloud

